SocialMesh Service Engine
----------------------------------------------------------------------

SERVICE ENGINE DESIGN LICENSE
The SocialMesh service engine design — including the mesh service
execution framework, automation engine interface, offline-first
service contract, service lifecycle model, and capability
advertisement schema — is published under the GNU Lesser General
Public License, version 3 only (LGPL-3.0-only).

This grants external applications the right to link against a
compatible implementation of the service engine without being
required to open-source their own application code, provided they
satisfy the LGPL conditions for the library boundary itself.

  SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-3.0-only
  Copyright (C) 2025-2026 gotnull (developer@socialmesh.app)

  Full text: licenses/LGPL-3.0 (repository root)

