as declared by the SPDX header present in every source file.

  SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
  Copyright (C) 2025-2026 gotnull (developer@socialmesh.app)

  Full text: LICENSE (repository root)

RATIONALE
The service engine Dart implementation imports from lib/core/,
lib/generated/meshtastic/ (GPL-3.0-only), and lib/services/protocol/
(GPL-3.0-or-later). Under GPL section 5, any work that incorporates
GPL code must itself be distributed under the GPL. The LGPL-3.0-only
grant above covers only the service engine design and interface
contract — it does not override the GPL terms that apply to this
compiled Dart implementation.

In plain terms:
  - You MAY design and implement a compatible service engine in your
    own project under LGPL-3.0-only terms, meaning your application
    code that merely uses the engine does not need to be open-sourced.
  - You MAY NOT copy, fork, or redistribute the Dart files in this
    directory under a non-GPL license.
  - If you modify the service engine itself (not just use it), those
    modifications must be released under LGPL-3.0-only or GPL-3.0-or-later.

MESHTASTIC DEPENDENCY NOTE
The service engine routes packets over the Meshtastic radio transport.
The Meshtastic protobuf integration (lib/generated/meshtastic/) is
GPL-3.0-only per upstream (https://github.com/meshtastic/protobufs).
This creates a GPL-3.0-only floor for any combined binary that
includes both layers.
